 "readmeHTML": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"docs/README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"./mmrs.svg\"><img src=\"./mmrs.svg\" alt=\"An implementation of a metamodule\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Magic Mount Metamodule</h1><a id=\"user-content-magic-mount-metamodule\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Magic Mount Metamodule\" href=\"#magic-mount-metamodule\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://t.me/mmrs_ci\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/1a90162d91a0f7595cedba100129da3b1fe18d64828b3f480038decfc866aec1/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f47726f75702d626c75653f7374796c653d666f722d7468652d6261646765266c6f676f3d74656c656772616d266c6162656c3d54656c656772616d\" alt=\"Telegram\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Group-blue?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=telegram&amp;label=Telegram\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/4ecf48530b6f7f5a1f4bea57e7477a92845dcbd24b255ae5f1a5eda2181012a7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f72656c656173652f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72733f6c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"Version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs?logo=github\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/99c90a585f9d698f54170fed72ab65874a294b322cb3385f611c37d7facba9f7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72732f746f74616c3f6c6f676f3d676974687562266c6f676f436f6c6f723d677265656e\" alt=\"GitHub Downloads\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/total?logo=github&amp;logoColor=green\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"README_en.md\">English</a> <a href=\"README_ru.md\">Русский</a></p>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">为 KernelSU/APatch 提供 Systemless 修改功能。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">作者由于学业原因，更新会放缓</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">配置</h2><a id=\"user-content-配置\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 配置\" href=\"#配置\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">配置文件路径：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>/data/adb/magic_mount/config.toml</code></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-toml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mountsource = &quot;KSU&quot;\numount = false\npartitions = []\nextra_mount = []\"><pre><span class=\"pl-smi\">mountsource</span> = <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>KSU<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">umount</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">partitions</span> = []\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">extra_mount</span> = []</pre></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>mountsource</td>\n<td>Systemless 挂载来源标识。默认值 \"KSU\" 与 KernelSU 行为保持一致。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>umount</td>\n<td>是否尝试卸载（依赖 KernelSU umount ）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partitions</td>\n<td>指定需要进行 Systemless 操作的特定分区列表，例如 \"mi_ext\",\"my_stock\" 等。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>extra_mount</code> 默认 <code>[]</code>。例如 <code>extra_mount = [\"my_product\"]</code> 将 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/my_product/</code> 内容合并挂载到 <code>/my_product/</code>，不从 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/system/my_product/</code> 读取。要求目标目录已存在，且 <code>/system/my_product</code> 完全没有目录项（包括悬空符号链接）。只填写单级分区名，不填写路径；无效条目记录日志并跳过。没有 <code>system/</code> 的模块也受支持，仍遵循 <code>disable</code>、<code>remove</code> 和 <code>skip_mount</code> 标记。编辑配置后重启生效。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">也可通过 WEBUI 配置页修改（推荐）；MiuiX 和 MD3 均提供“额外挂载分区（模块顶层）”编辑控件，支持添加和删除 <code>extra_mount</code> 分区名。保存后重启生效。</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">目录标记</h2><a id=\"user-content-目录标记\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 目录标记\" href=\"#目录标记\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在模块对应目录中创建空标记文件，重启后生效：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>.replace</code>：用模块目录内容替换目标目录，不保留原有内容。</li>\n<li><code>.remove</code>：隐藏整个目标目录及其内容，例如 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/system/app/Foo/.remove</code> 隐藏 <code>/system/app/Foo</code>。仅对目录节点生效，不支持对普通文件或符号链接添加此属性；原始文件不会被删除。</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>.remove</code> 优先于同目录的 <code>.replace</code>，该目录内的模块内容不会挂载。两种标记文件本身均不挂载，<code>extra_mount</code> 下的目录采用相同用法。模块根目录的 <code>remove</code>（无点号）仍表示移除模块，与 <code>.remove</code> 不同。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">自定义 Lua 钩子</h2><a id=\"user-content-自定义-lua-钩子\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 自定义 Lua 钩子\" href=\"#自定义-lua-钩子\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Lua 5.4 钩子取代旧文本 DSL 和声明式规则。<strong>不兼容变更：</strong>\n<code>/data/adb/magic_mount/custom</code> 和 <code>/data/adb/magic_mount/custom.lua</code> 不再受支持，也不会被读取。\n请在重启前手动将旧规则转换为钩子，并将脚本移入 <code>/data/adb/magic_mount/lua/</code>。\nWebUI 已移除忽略列表和自定义 bind 管理，且绝不会编辑脚本。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">按文件名升序加载 <code>/data/adb/magic_mount/lua/</code> 中所有直接子级的普通 <code>.lua</code> 文件，\n例如 <code>10-skip.lua</code>、<code>20-bind.lua</code>；不扫描子目录，也不加载符号链接文件。\n目录不存在表示没有钩子；目录访问、读取或脚本加载错误会终止执行，不会被忽略。\n每个脚本使用独立 Lua VM，全局变量不会在脚本间泄漏。两个钩子均可省略。\n例如创建 <code>/data/adb/magic_mount/lua/10-custom.lua</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"function before()\n    if modules[&quot;example&quot;] then\n        modules[&quot;example&quot;].skip = true\n    end\nend\n\nfunction after()\n    bind(&quot;/data/local/tmp/source file&quot;, &quot;/system/etc/hosts&quot;)\nend\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">before</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">modules</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>example<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>] <span class=\"pl-k\">then</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">modules</span>[<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>example<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>].<span class=\"pl-e\">skip</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">true</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">after</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">bind</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/data/local/tmp/source file<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/system/etc/hosts<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">所有 <code>before()</code> 按文件名顺序在模块收集和挂载前运行。<code>modules</code> 按模块 ID 索引，每项包含\n<code>id</code>、<code>name</code>、<code>version</code>、<code>author</code>、<code>description</code>、<code>mode</code>、<code>is_mounted</code>、<code>enabled</code>、\n<code>source_path</code>、<code>rules</code>（含 <code>default_mode</code> 和 <code>paths</code>）以及可修改的布尔值 <code>skip</code>。\n任一脚本设为 <code>skip = true</code> 即跳过该模块，其他脚本不能通过 <code>false</code> 重新启用；\n<code>false</code> 也不能覆盖 <code>disable</code>、<code>remove</code> 或 <code>skip_mount</code> 标记的排除效果。\n<code>moduledir</code> 是模块根目录（<code>/data/adb/modules</code>）。所有 <code>after()</code> 仅在 Magic Mount 成功后\n按文件名顺序运行，只提供 <code>bind(source, target)</code> 挂载 API，没有 <code>ignore</code> 或跳过模块的 API。\n仅当全部 <code>after()</code> 成功后才应用排队的 bind。错误包含脚本路径，并终止当前阶段：\n加载、语法或 <code>before</code> 错误会在挂载前终止；<code>after</code> 错误会取消全部排队的 bind，\n但不会回滚已完成的 Magic Mount。路径不能为空或包含控制字符。\n脚本是可信的本地配置，没有运行时间或内存配额。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>modules</code> 命令及 WebUI 按模块 ID 从启动快照还原 <code>is_mounted</code>、<code>mode</code> 和 <code>rules</code>，\n因此 Lua 跳过的模块显示为未挂载。启动后新增、尚未进入快照的模块也显示为未挂载；\n名称、版本和启用状态仍来自当前模块文件，修改这些信息不会改变本次启动的挂载状态。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Lua 提供安全的基础库及 table、string、math、utf8 库，不提供 <code>os</code>、<code>io</code>、<code>package</code>、\n<code>debug</code> 或文件加载器。bind 目标必须是绝对路径，不能包含 <code>..</code> 路径分量；目标不存在时，\n会从最近存在的非根祖先构造临时镜像。bind 保持只读，任意 remount 或登记失败都会 detach 回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">开发</h2><a id=\"user-content-开发\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 开发\" href=\"#开发\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">依赖：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rust nightly toolchain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Android NDK</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cargo-ndk</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Node.js / npm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>pnpm</code> and <code>vite</code> as dependency and frontend for webui</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">环境变量：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export ANDROID_NDK_HOME=&lt;path/to/ndk&gt;\nexport ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=$ANDROID_NDK_HOME\n\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_HOME=<span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>path/to/ndk<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$ANDROID_NDK_HOME</span>\n</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cargo xtask build\"><pre>cargo xtask build</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Android lint 与最低支持的 API 26 对齐：\n<code>cargo ndk --platform 26 -t arm64-v8a -t armeabi-v7a clippy -- -D warnings</code>。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建产物将位于：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>output/magic_mount_rs-*.zip</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">致谢</h2><a id=\"user-content-致谢\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 致谢\" href=\"#致谢\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/5ec1cff/KernelSU/blob/52f1f575ce2bd0ca46ebf644fd00a838af9f344e/userspace/ksud/src/magic_mount.rs\">5ec1cff/KernelSU</a>：原始实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/YuzakiKokuban\">YuzakiKokuban</a> Webui修改</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">许可证</h2><a id=\"user-content-许可证\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 许可证\" href=\"#许可证\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-v3 许可证</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Star History</h2><a id=\"user-content-star-history\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Star History